{
  "$comment": "Tested render presets (planning phase: headless Chromium, SwiftShader). Colours are sRGB channel values in 0..1 (hex / 255) written straight to the framebuffer (no linear conversion). fsFile is relative to reference/shaders/. A scene pass renders into a half-resolution target named by `target`; the paint pass samples it through `uSrc`.",
  "scaling": {
    "baseWidth": 1440,
    "rule": "When rendering at another width W, multiply uStroke and the pixel components of uSliceBand (z = line spacing px, w = displacement px) by W / 1440. Everything else is resolution-independent.",
    "outputs": "Paintings: 2400 px wide (aspect per DESIGN §8.2). Membrane poster: 2560 x 1440 at uTime 2.0."
  },
